            "id": "W15.SPORT.01",
            "statement": "Separate bench trials, casual practice/rival races, funded meets, qualifying events and exhibitions. Each states which outcome it records and which reward or advancement it can actually award.",
            "purpose": "Every real finish matters within its context without paying an infinite purse."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.02",
            "statement": "Clubs continue practice, informal rivalry, trade and display outside a championship edition. Availability depends on the place and its resources, not exhaustion of a three-entry prototype list.",
            "purpose": "The world-popular hobby remains after a player completes a particular programme."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.03",
