            "purpose": "Repeat participation is genuine activity, not duplicated settlement."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.04",
            "statement": "The championship path remains Locals, Regionals, Factionals and representation at New World City. Those qualifications control their competitions, not the existence or purchase of genes, tools or donor forms.",
            "purpose": "Competitive prestige does not force every hobbyist into the same career."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.05",
            "statement": "Open preserves build freedom; Speedsters restrict dedicated weapons; Fireworks requires functional offense and light carapace; sustained Flyers race Flyers. No runtime absence deletes a division from the reference universe.",
            "purpose": "The original class identities survive later technical choices."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.06",
            "statement": "Every event monograph specifies actual field interaction, roster, starting treatment, allowed between-round changes, progression and intended session burden. Sequential mirrored pairs are one option, not a claim of simultaneous pack physics or a universal beginner format.",
            "purpose": "Sporting purpose determines the programme; a solver convenience does not dictate the whole world."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.07",
            "statement": "A loss preserves its truthful classification and can still produce observed performance, a personal record or relevant experience. It does not automatically pay a consolation purse or guarantee useful stock.",
            "purpose": "Feedback supports another attempt without making defeat meaningless."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.08",
            "statement": "Preparation information is accessible before entry. Rivals use declared constructions and bounded knowledge rather than reading the player’s hidden genome for a perfect counter.",
            "purpose": "Improvement and inspection reward actual understanding."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.SPORT.09",
            "statement": "A season introduces new opponents, published layouts, stock activity and product interests without erasing the player’s specimens, line work or permanent records. Offline default pause remains.",
            "purpose": "There is an inviting reason to return without a compulsory reset or real-world attendance streak."
