            "statement": "A completed project records its actual result: named build, race, captured stock, selected brood, fulfilled delivery or displayed piece. It does not immediately replace that result with a compulsory next checklist.",
            "purpose": "Success remains perceivable rather than vanishing beneath new demands."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.02",
            "statement": "The player may retain one current next intention and optional later interests. These are pointers to existing sources, builds and obligations, not newly granted resources or permanently reserved all-purpose candidates.",
            "purpose": "The next session begins with a reason to act, not a memory test."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.03",
            "statement": "Before leaving, show unstarted production plans, already living care obligations, protected stock and accepted deadlines separately. The user may stop new starts or select an appropriate care plan.",
            "purpose": "Closing the application does not demand a long inventory-cleaning ritual."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.04",
            "statement": "Default offline pause stops the world calendar consistently. Resuming does not charge unplayed days, destroy stock, reset streaks or award unearned production.",
            "purpose": "The return incentive is an attractive project rather than fear of absence."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.05",
            "statement": "In-world waiting advances the relevant care, development and customer schedules together. It cannot advance profits while freezing expenses or preserve one larval stage without its actual supporting method.",
            "purpose": "Convenience preserves the world’s material relationships."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.06",
            "statement": "Return information leads with the chosen project and completed changes since the prior in-world activity, followed by only actionable blockers. Expert records remain available.",
            "purpose": "Optional depth does not mean every entry begins as an administrative dashboard."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.07",
            "statement": "For downstream readers, W15 amendments override only their named qualitative interpretations. Author premises govern; prior measured examples, code and histories remain unchanged.",
            "purpose": "One current reading route prevents a prototype number from silently becoming universe law."
          },
          {
            "id": "W15.RETURN.08",
            "statement": "Every future content addition states the immediate pleasure it enables, the longer project it supports, the actual object it changes, and its acceptance question. A feature with only maintenance costs and no new useful decision is revised before expansion.",
            "purpose": "The next wave continues integrated design instead of adding isolated systems for their own sake."
          }
        ],
